{
  "html": [
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "This is the first part of a series examining ancient supply chains. Although the kingdom has an unfair reputation for being a land of peaceful traders,"
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:1"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "1"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " it was in fact a formidable military power — eclipsed only by its greatest rival."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The kingdom is notable for being the only power that seriously challenged its rival on even footing, pushing them to the brink of defeat "
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "em",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "twice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:2"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "2"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Peak mobilization reached approximately 165,000 soldiers under arms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:3"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "3"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " We will work through the components of that force and note how each changed over time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "ol",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "A. Smith, "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "em",
              "attributes": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "A History of Naval Power Before the Great War"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " (1954), 334. To say this reputation contradicts our sources would be a "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "em",
              "attributes": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "element",
                  "name": "strong",
                  "attributes": [],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "text": "staggering"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " understatement."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fnref:1"
                ],
                [
                  "title",
                  "return to article"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "↩"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Calculating the combined losses is necessarily guesswork, but the heaviest losses were approximately 2,200, with the rest below 1,000 each."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fnref:2"
                ],
                [
                  "title",
                  "return to article"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "↩"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "That is "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "em",
              "attributes": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "double"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " the peak mobilization of any other ancient state. For more on maximum mobilization figures, see M.J. Taylor, "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "em",
              "attributes": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "element",
                  "name": "a",
                  "attributes": [
                    [
                      "href",
                      "https://example.com/soldiers-and-silver"
                    ]
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "text": "Soldiers & Silver"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " (2020)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
